<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS - WSC - 03-JUN.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS - WSC - 03-JUN.</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Storm Andres, with 40 mph winds, is 250 miles southeast of Acapulco, Mexico and nearly stationary. This system will affect shipping as it tracks towards the coast of southeast Mexico during the next 24-36 hours. Top winds remain at about 40 mph during this time. Landfall is expected at about midday Wednesday.</p>
</text>
